":[{"name":"eyes","count":2,"users":["U81LLJ340","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZJZ19"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19ae1c72-a340-4048-910c-678ee19ee287","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"とはいえed25519の攻撃耐性(計算量)を概算でも知らないんだよな。そっちは勉強する必要がある。","ts":"1614910691.185200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kkmxR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5751ed9c-a93d-43b1-8ec8-411188ed86d6","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"GitHub に２個ほど実装してるコードあったけど、どっちもコメントに「この部分どう実装したらいいか分からない」みたいな事が書かれてる箇所があって、そこ次第かなぁという感じ。","ts":"1614910621.184500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":2,"users":["U06BRP8VD","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nuv/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"949d0a94-fa15-40c0-a954-c0c048670ad3","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"論文、書いてあるのは結構古くからある手法の組み合わせぽくて、とにかく格子を簡約するって感じのロジックなので、もしかしたら条件配下の一部の素因数分解だけ速くなるって話なのかも。","ts":"1614910548.183400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":3,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","U81LLJ340","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Pfh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"766aac42-9a11-4b2f-8bb3-c284dc146eb7","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"ed25519の一番のメリットは変に改行が入ってしまわないってことなんじゃと昨日コピペしながら思いましたね","ts":"1614910523.183100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":3,"users":["U06BRP8VD","U01BY3SDBRS","UGH7U3SF2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ghntu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"695a9a45-5767-4524-9637-5bfec3343cf6","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"引用か所間違えてたw","ts":"1614910438.180900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pdMuc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9a116364-dcd5-4fd3-ba69-b9193e1d67ca","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"新しく作るならそうですね。\n\nでもいま十分な強度を持ってる鍵を使ってるかどうかと、鍵を変える瞬間のセキュリティ的なリスクをエンジニアリングとして考慮してないように見えるムーブ(ブーム?)だったので。\n\n\u0026gt; 短いRSA鍵はそれとは関係なくそろそろ変えたほうが良い\nちなみに僕のこれにはGPUなどによる計算リソースの増大により過去の1024はもうだめだし、2048は年単位であればとけるかも?でも4096ならまず大丈夫かなという判断があります。","ts":"1614910409.180200","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1614910432.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zvibK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7c2e902a-a4a3-4a5b-b8f6-9f9b7d394450","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"個人のは一通り入れ替えました。","ts":"1614910405.180100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JQws"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4e1bdec8-b9c6-457d-90e6-def26bdb7860","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"GitHubもデフォルトed25519に記述変わっているわけですし、それで十分じゃないですかね？\n\u003chttps://docs.github.com/en/github/authenticating-to-github/generating-a-new-ssh-key-and-adding-it-to-the-ssh-agent\u003e","ts":"1614910154.175900","attachments":[{"fallback":"Generating a new SSH key and adding it to the ssh-agent - GitHub Docs","id":1,"title":"Generating a new SSH key and adding it to the ssh-agent - GitHub Docs","title_link":"https://docs.github.com/en/github/authenticating-to-github/generating-a-new-ssh-key-and-adding-it-to-the-ssh-agent","text":"After you've checked for existing SSH keys, you can generate a new SSH key to use for authentication, then add it to the ssh-agent.","blocks":null,"service_name":"docs.github.com","from_url":"https://docs.github.com/en/github/authenticating-to-github/generating-a-new-ssh-key-and-adding-it-to-the-ssh-agent","original_url":"https://docs.github.com/en/github/authenticating-to-github/generating-a-new-ssh-key-and-adding-it-to-the-ssh-agent"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TMM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"79302fd4-9c57-485c-b03a-ba30793d2d95","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"RSAだけど4096bitにしておいたりはした...が、まあECDSAやed25519が使えてるからやっぱ消すかな、で消しました。","ts":"1614910122.175300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tOR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85c71c75-e383-42ad-8d37-c891d6eb9b2f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"逆に鍵を変える瞬間のほうが危ないまである。","ts":"1614910107.175000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k3O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5d025e0b-d3e8-49d5-8de7-45f09c4e91cd","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"\u0026gt; そろそろRSAから乗り換えたほうがいい\nこれに妥当な根拠がないことを憂慮しているわけです。","ts":"1614910090.174300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mIf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"beecde16-df48-4e11-96a6-5df49e3e3d1e","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"で、どうせ変えるならed25519が選択肢になる、くらいです。リスクとコストをちゃんと見るのがsecurityエンジニアリングの観点からは正しい。\n\nあの査読も受けてない論文に感情的に反応して変えるのは、エンジニアとしては間違いだと考えます。","ts":"1614909916.173500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WVO7T"}]},{"client_msg_id":"89d2e2e1-e02d-464a-9309-7e64c5854fa9","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"たぶんみんなそれはわかっていて（ここにいる人は）、けどとりあえずもうそろそろRSAから乗り換えたほうがいいよねってきっかけになってとてもよかったと思いますね。ときどきあるこういうタイミングに乗るの大事","ts":"1614909868.172600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"c1EV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"13bbbe3c-07e9-4ef0-96d9-8ef1f7d4094e","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"ただ短いRSA鍵はそれとは関係なくそろそろ変えたほうが良い。僕もいくつかまだ持ってるけどもw","ts":"1614909790.170600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QB1I"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3496edc6-d47d-4364-a4c3-bb58181d3b66","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"そもそもの前提としてあの「RSAを破壊した」論文は現時点では間違ってそうだから、別に急いで変える必要もないんですよ。","ts":"1614909749.169800","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1614909760.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":7,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0","UAZ33BKV2","U8CC7MDCL","U7JL1UKKL","U01BY3SDBRS","U9S4G0LJW","U01ATUT6PL3"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"g6rk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f9948537-7785-4557-aaa2-29c0860a2847","type":"message","user":"UGH7U3SF2","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/mirachan010.keys|https://github.com/mirachan010.keys\u003e\nRSAしかなかった","ts":"1614906245.168600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":2,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS","UDDCM376D"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dBTh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"D7F1822D-8363-4C3F-A026-251D87D367F9","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"デバイス別・ドメイン別で鍵を分けてしまっているので移行作業がなかなかしんどい","ts":"1614904250.167800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"z9Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"712c0fe3-163b-47ad-91a3-c49a3a462f20","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"GitLab、BitBucketもRSAは消した(ecdsaとed25519)は登録済みだったので削除一発","ts":"1614903980.166600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bf31M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"105bee7f-f1e3-44a1-823b-6bb533911d24","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"メインなGitHubは消してあった、:banjaku:","ts":"1614903740.165800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3hLw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a7982849-4e23-45b2-8543-7d8513c29dfe","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"古いとこのクライアントむけにRSA残してあるけど消すかなー。","ts":"1614903541.165500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zYYD"}]},