}]},{"client_msg_id":"7903de18-aeb4-499e-93d4-ae45792a5b3b","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"その調子で名前ももう少し短くしてほしいところ・・・","ts":"1614872947.143900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iq6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b6e68a4-ffa8-43b9-a1b6-4950498387bd","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"こんな短いので網羅できてるのすごい。","ts":"1614872905.143400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"L0/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d694fefe-58e1-4658-b365-b8e9fa777f40","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":":sorena:","ts":"1614872871.142800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QKk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"23053eb3-0a11-40d1-b7bd-843ba6b3c416","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"なお少し前にed25519の鍵つくったら、短くてビビった記憶があります。","ts":"1614872748.142400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]},{"name":"wakaru","count":5,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","U01ATUT6PL3","UFHQ7TNT0","U9S4G0LJW","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ky1h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7727f055-18e4-431f-bc49-3a3f6d2fa8b0","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"\u003chttps://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%A8%E3%83%89%E3%83%AF%E3%83%BC%E3%82%BA%E6%9B%B2%E7%B7%9A%E3%83%87%E3%82%B8%E3%82%BF%E3%83%AB%E7%BD%B2%E5%90%8D%E3%82%A2%E3%83%AB%E3%82%B4%E3%83%AA%E3%82%BA%E3%83%A0\u003e","ts":"1614872686.141600","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: エドワーズ曲線デジタル署名アルゴリズム","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/","title":"エドワーズ曲線デジタル署名アルゴリズム","title_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%A8%E3%83%89%E3%83%AF%E3%83%BC%E3%82%BA%E6%9B%B2%E7%B7%9A%E3%83%87%E3%82%B8%E3%82%BF%E3%83%AB%E7%BD%B2%E5%90%8D%E3%82%A2%E3%83%AB%E3%82%B4%E3%83%AA%E3%82%BA%E3%83%A0","text":"エドワーズ曲線デジタル署名アルゴリズム（えどわーずきょくせんデジタルしょめいあるごりずむ、英語: Edwards-curve Digital Signature Algorithm）、略称：EdDSA)は、公開鍵暗号において、ツイストエドワーズ曲線に基づくシュノア署名の一種を用いたデジタル署名の一つである。他のデジタル署名において見つかっている安全性に関する問題を回避した上で、高効率で暗号化処理が行われるように設計されている。エドワーズ曲線電子署名アルゴリズムは、ダニエル・バーンスタインが率いるチームによって開発された 。","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%A8%E3%83%89%E3%83%AF%E3%83%BC%E3%82%BA%E6%9B%B2%E7%B7%9A%E3%83%87%E3%82%B8%E3%82%BF%E3%83%AB%E7%BD%B2%E5%90%8D%E3%82%A2%E3%83%AB%E3%82%B4%E3%83%AA%E3%82%BA%E3%83%A0","original_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%A8%E3%83%89%E3%83%AF%E3%83%BC%E3%82%BA%E6%9B%B2%E7%B7%9A%E3%83%87%E3%82%B8%E3%82%BF%E3%83%AB%E7%BD%B2%E5%90%8D%E3%82%A2%E3%83%AB%E3%82%B4%E3%83%AA%E3%82%BA%E3%83%A0"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uqo5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c625f223-ef3a-4072-a781-1b942c3f5be6","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"楕円曲線暗号って考えて良いみたいね。","ts":"1614872607.141000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GxhUN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ee107bc2-3f8c-43b7-b704-8a311694a1de","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"SSL は DH 鍵交換の公開鍵の時に使われるんかな。鍵自身は RSA は使えないらしい。","ts":"1614872582.140400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U06BRP8VD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"thF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6d11e70-f2c8-49d9-91ad-d2c1dc33779d","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"ed25519 って楕円だと思ってた","ts":"1614872577.140200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K5j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e04f57a3-ca79-4852-8b88-028eb4d5052f","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"そしてここに出てくるシュノア署名ですよ。","ts":"1614872560.139200","edited":{"user":"U06BRP8VD","ts":"1614872571.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fGwK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fab3000f-2015-4f54-98a2-dd7d35d288a0","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"いや楕円ではないか。","ts":"1614872551.138900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GMSRi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d3d0f14d-6f95-43a9-81ad-121dcaf8f69d","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"\u003chttps://docs.github.com/ja/github/authenticating-to-github/generating-a-new-ssh-key-and-adding-it-to-the-ssh-agent\u003e\n\n\u0026gt; ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -C \"\u003cmailto:your_email@example.com|your_email@example.com\u003e\"","ts":"1614872509.137800","attachments":[{"fallback":"新しい SSH キーを生成して ssh-agent に追加する - GitHub Docs","id":1,"title":"新しい SSH キーを生成して ssh-agent に追加する - GitHub Docs","title_link":"https://docs.github.com/ja/github/authenticating-to-github/generating-a-new-ssh-key-and-adding-it-to-the-ssh-agent","text":"既存の SSH キーをチェックした後、新しい SSH キーを生成して認証に使用し、ssh-agent に追加できます。","blocks":null,"service_name":"docs.github.com","from_url":"https://docs.github.com/ja/github/authenticating-to-github/generating-a-new-ssh-key-and-adding-it-to-the-ssh-agent","original_url":"https://docs.github.com/ja/github/authenticating-to-github/generating-a-new-ssh-key-and-adding-it-to-the-ssh-agent"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hhB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"65d20a7e-03cd-4a5c-852e-32bb14f9aca2","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"GitHubの鍵を作るマニュアルは、たしか楕円曲線暗号系のやつになってた。","ts":"1614872470.137400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":4,"users":["UL6CFN8NR","U9S4G0LJW","U01ATUT6PL3","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bt9="}]},{"client_msg_id":"fd5526ba-c211-4951-b4f8-6c02aa76e83c","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"現実に使われているSSL証明書の暗号化方式は RSA が多い印象がありますが…どうなんでしょうか？","ts":"1614872427.136600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+axb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"03889f8e-36ff-4f05-96f5-924c3a70cf95","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"TLSなんで鍵次第、というところでしょうかね。","ts":"1614872425.136400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"n1sZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"255a6ad8-60e6-4458-aa4f-7ec2da90d749","type":"message","user":"U01ATUT6PL3","text":"HTTPS って RSA 暗号に基づいてましたっけ（全然わからん）","ts":"1614872245.134400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KQ0c"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5332c8e-43d3-42ef-a6a2-3d90d3166220","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"実際、上のアルゴリズムが仮に正しかったとしたら、影響範囲はどれくらいなんでしょうね？","ts":"1614872213.133900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["U01ATUT6PL3"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UWSO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b54a4e6-5813-4e33-94e8-9cc0210612af","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"暗号理論、全くの専門外だけど本は2冊ほど持ってる（積ん読状態）","ts":"1614871165.132700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MV/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b10609bf-1c72-479d-8530-b93a5f2fb580","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"上にも出てるけど結城先生のやつもそういえばありましたね","ts":"1614871164.132500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tjl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d50ce6a0-8611-4c59-bd5d-e5235b6bbbfd","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"面白そうー","ts":"1614871151.132000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zIm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2a260db1-b6ce-40b9-86a7-9e9812efa7c4","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"よさそう。","ts":"1614871125.131500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replac